# Build context for images built from the repository root (the AntWeb export image,
# docker/antcat-database.docker, and the dev image). Their containers mount the
# checkout at /code, so generated data does not need to be copied into the image.
# Copying it filled the antcat-export disk on 2026-10-15 ("no space left on device").
# antcat.org's own image (dockerized_app/) has its own build context and is not affected.
.git
node_modules
log
tmp
coverage
public/assets
public/packs
public/packs-test
data/output
data/db_dumps
data/gbif_exports
data/antweb_exports
database_export
database_archive
run-results
solr/*/data
dockerized_app/sql-data*
docker_migration/sql-data
